        <article><a class="service-card" href="/products/"><div><span class="service-number">01 / GASOLINE</span><h3>Gasoline</h3><p>Reliable supply for convenience stores and businesses that cannot afford an empty tank.</p></div><span class="service-link">Explore gasoline →</span></a></article>
