        <article><a class="service-card" href="/products/"><div><span class="service-number">03 / DIESEL</span><h3>Diesel</h3><p>On-time diesel deliveries for the farms, job sites, and fleets that keep the region working.</p></div><span class="service-link">Explore diesel →</span></a></article>
